<title>USA: Production Operators Q4 net profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Production Operators Q4 net profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit	$0.46	     loss $0.27</p>
<p> Net profit	4,792	     loss 2,823</p>
<p> Net revs	  24,745		   19,455</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  10,317		   10,245</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit	$1.70	   profit $0.67</p>
<p> Net profit	17,496	  profit 6,826</p>
<p> Net revs	  90,536		   71,245</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  10,291		   10,203</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Period ended September 30.</p>
<p>Q4 1995 results include loss from discontinued operations of $0.67 per share.  12 months ended Sept 30 1995 results include loss from discontinued operations of $0.70 per share.</p>
<p>Full company name is Production Operators Corp</p>
